        {
          "name": "Breath Wing",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "5/day, a tot aevis can use its wings to cause a breath-like attack to slice the air in front of it in a 30-ft.-cone. Creatures within the area of effect take 8d6 points of wind damage, Reflex save (DC 20) for half damage. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 4th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 23).",
          "notes": {
